  "description": {
   "en": "Seemingly gloomy and low-profile, but in reality, a proud domineering vampire queen —vs— a school heartthrob who appears poor but is actually a cunning \"green tea\" loyal dog.\n\nThe hunter becomes the hunted.\n\nA \"poor\" university student plays the fool, hiding his true strength, all to make the vampire completely devoted to him?\n\nWhen Shi An witnesses Jing Ying transform from a tiny bat into a human and straddle him, he finally realizes that vampires aren’t just myths. Jing Ying demands that he become his personal blood pet."
  },
